# ENV REGISTER: a verdict for every setting this serve reads, from the engine's own table.
# One line per setting the launcher does not set: default-ok (with its measurement),
# debt (explicit and counted, to be measured) or unreachable (with the reason).
# check-env-coverage.py fails on any setting with no line and on any line with no setting.

# One line per setting the launcher does not set: default-ok (with its measurement),
# debt (explicit and counted, to be measured) or unreachable (with the reason).
# check-env-coverage.py fails on any setting with no line and on any line with no setting.

# One line per setting the launcher does not set: default-ok (with its measurement),
# debt (explicit and counted, to be measured) or unreachable (with the reason).
# check-env-coverage.py fails on any setting with no line and on any line with no setting.


# Added by update-env-register.py against tensorfol.
# debt TF_FLASHNEXT_BATCH_DRAWS: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1 (0 restores per-stream Flash Next row draws; default 1); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_STARTUP_RECEIPT: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1 (opt-in startup and first completion receipts); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_VIDEO_TOKENS: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a nonnegative whole video-token budget (default 16384; unsigned 64-bit count); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_MAX_PDF_PAGES: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole number from 1 to 4294967295 (capped by --vision-max-images); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_PRESSURE_CACHE_PERCENT: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole percentage from 0 to 100; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_PREFIX_WAIT_MS: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms whole milliseconds from 0 to 4294967295 (0 disables waiting); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_RESTORE_PREFETCH: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole unsigned 64-bit read count (0 disables reading ahead; capped at 65536); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_RESTORE_PREFETCH_GIB: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole unsigned 64-bit GiB count (capped at 16777216); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_RESTORE_PREFETCH_MS: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms whole unsigned 64-bit milliseconds (capped at 1099511627776); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_TOOL_ID_KEY_FILE: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a path without control characters to a file only its owner can read, holding at least 32 key bytes; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_CUDA_KERNELS: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a captured kernel set's folder without control characters, or native for the engine's own kernels; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_CUDA_DEVICE: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole GPU ordinal from 0 to 4294967295, or empty for the default; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_CUDA_SEGMENTS: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole number from 1 to 4, or empty for the default; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_CUDA_CARVEOUT: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_CUDA_CARVEOUT_MIB: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a positive whole MiB count fitting a native byte size, or empty for 1792 MiB; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_MTP_DRAFTS: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole number from 0 to 4294967295 (clamped to the drafter's window); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_DSPINE_WINDOW: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole row count from 16 to 8192, at most the DSpine drafter's own sliding_window; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_DRAFT_NODES: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole nonnegative native-size node count (capped by the drafter's window); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_QMMF_HALF_BELOW: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole nonnegative native-size block count (0 disables half tiles); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_PROMPT_CACHE_KEEP_OTHERS: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_PROMPT_INTERMEDIATE: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1 (default 0); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_ROCE_GID_INDEX: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole GID index from 0 to 2147483647; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_HOST_CACHE: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_VISION_HOST: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_PROF: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_LINK_WAIT: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_PDL: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_PROMPT_STEPS: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_SHARED: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_DSEL: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_DFLASH2_LOG: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole unsigned 64-bit round count (0 logs no drafts); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_DRAFT_CONFIDENCE: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a finite chain-chance cut from 0 to 1 (default 0.7); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_CONTEXT_CEILING: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole token count from 1 to 2147483616 (the window GLM-5.3-Flash may serve in place of config.json's); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md

# Added by update-env-register.py against tensorfol.
# debt TF_CACHE_EVICT: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms main or decayed_resume (default main); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_SHARED_PRICE_LOG: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1 (1 logs the shared plain price, a line a round); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_DEVICE_CHECK: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1 (0 skips serve's device-profile check; default 1); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_PARALLEL: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole number from 1 to 4096, or auto (up to 8 lanes; the --parallel flag wins when present); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_NCCL_LIB: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms an NCCL library path without control characters, or blank for libnccl.so.2; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_HY4_MEM_FLOOR_GIB: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms whole GiB of MemAvailable below which the Hy4-flash CUDA loader stops (default 10); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_MEMORY_RESERVE_GIB: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a finite GiB amount (the HIP admission's floor and the memory's size still bound it); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_HIP_MEMORY_LIMIT_GB: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a finite GiB amount (the HIP admission still fits its byte count in a 64-bit size); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_QWEN_KEEP_LATE: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1 (default 0); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_QWEN_KV_PAGE_TEST: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole page size from 1 to 2147483647 (unset: off); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_COST_KEY_TRACE: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1 (default 0); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_TIMING: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1 (default 0); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_NO_TREES: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1 (default 0; 1 keeps the CUDA drafter's chains only); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_MTP_TREES: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1 (default 0); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_MTP_BATCH: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1 (default 1; 0 keeps one stream at a time); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_QWEN_POOL_LOG: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1 (default 0); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_Q27_POCKET_OFF: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms all, or a list of layer:neuron pairs without control characters (default off); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_Q27_TAIL: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms off (default: each nudged sequence's tail rows); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_Q27_GEMM: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms narrow (default: 128x128 tiles); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_LFM2_KV_PAGES: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1 (unset leases pool pages); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_UNIFIED_HOST_COUNTS: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1 (an integrated GPU on Linux: 1 counts /proc/meminfo, 0 the CUDA pool); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_QWEN35_CHUNK_SOLO: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a solo prompt pass's rows, 4096 (off) or 8192; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_RANK: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole rank from 0; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_WORLD: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole world size from 1; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_DSCORES: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_EXPERT_FORM: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms classic or factored at every width (unset races the two at each width when a build first loads); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_KDA_DUMP: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a file path without control characters, where one projected KDA input stack is written; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_INDEX_DECODE_FROM: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole context position from which decode windows take the index kernels (0: any depth); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_OVN_DECODE_INDEX: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole row count, 0 (off) or the rows below which a decode window scores with shared key tiles and the split select; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_OVN_KVB8: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_OVN_FRONT_ROWS: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole number: the rows a piece-by-piece front range takes at least, 0 (off) a range a piece; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_OVN_GLUE_FUSE: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole row count, 0 (off) or the most rows a decode window glues in one fused kernel; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_OVN_GLUE_ROW: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole row count, 0 (off) or the rows from which a prompt piece glues in one kernel; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_OVN_PDL_EARLY: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 (off), 1 (decode windows' glue launches dependent-ready) or 2 (prompt chunks too); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_OVN_DISK_SLICE_MIB: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole MiB count, 0 (off) or the most a disk restore scatters a turn while other streams run; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_INDEX_CUDA: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 1 (both kernels), 0 (neither), scores (scores only) or all (both, and decode windows too; unset or blank is both); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_KV_HOST_GIB: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a finite GiB amount of at least 0 (unset or blank uses one full window and 16 rows a page); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
